        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, even with adequate insurance and indemnification, any claims of non-compliance could significantly damage our reputation and consumer confidence in the products we sell.",
        "start_character": 43760,
        "end_character": 43938
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also believe that the overall excess inventory market continues to grow due to increased manufacturing capacities and rapidly changing product assortments.",
        "start_character": 11569,
        "end_character": 11727
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop and improve tools that provide IOs with actionable insights on sales, margin and customer behavior, enabling them to further grow their business.",
        "start_character": 26564,
        "end_character": 26720
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have entered into an Operator Agreement with each IO, which grants that IO a license to operate a particular Grocery Outlet Bargain Market retail store and to use our trademarks, service marks, trade names, brand names and logos under our brand standards.",
        "start_character": 18791,
        "end_character": 19049
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We selected and developed these technologies to provide the flexibility and functionality to support our unique buying and selling model as well as to identify and respond to merchandising and operating trends in our business.",
        "start_character": 34018,
        "end_character": 34244
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•How we sell: Our Grocery Outlet stores are primarily independently operated by entrepreneurial IOs, who are small business owners that have a relentless focus on selecting the best products for their communities, providing personalized customer service and driving improved store performance.",
        "start_character": 2362,
        "end_character": 2655
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of January 3, 2026, we distributed inventory through nine primary distribution centers, four of which we operate (for dry goods) and five of which are operated by third parties (for cold items, produce and dry goods).",
        "start_character": 14689,
        "end_character": 14909
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of our succession planning, we prioritize growing talent internally within our organization and invest resources to develop our employees' skill sets and career paths.",
        "start_character": 46538,
        "end_character": 46713
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we replaced our internally-developed legacy applications with a customized enterprise resource planning system, including our financial ledger, purchasing, inventory management and reporting platforms as well as integrations with our warehouse and store systems.",
        "start_character": 35106,
        "end_character": 35381
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These improvements, which we intend to roll out at a significant number of additional stores in fiscal 2026 and thereafter, are designed to create a more inviting and more intuitive customer shopping experience.",
        "start_character": 25670,
        "end_character": 25881
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001771515-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001771515-26-000015-df049ad128adb985",
        "accession_number": "0001771515-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also market via television, streaming television platforms and radio (terrestrial and digital) to specific markets to build brand awareness and highlight the value we provide.",
